            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Hàn Quốc",
            "review_text": "Liam H\nHai Tien, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nMy trip ended wonderfully here.\nAug 2024 • Business\nI was very satisfied after visiting this restaurant. Clean interior, friendly customer service, and very important Korean traditional food. I will visit here again when I have the chance. Everything was perfect for dinner.\nInsider tip:\nApproximately 8 to 10 side dishes, water, and wet towels are provided free of charge. Side dishes can be refilled without limit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 26, 2024",
